<</P 1018 0 R /S/Diagram/Alt(Market Data: Flexibility requests, unique bid IDs, price information, and activation signals.\rTechnical & Metering Data: Real-time telemetry, validated historical metering data, and baselines \(the reference profile used to calculate how much energy was actually shifted\).\rEdge Device Data: Information on specific appliance energy use from Demand Management Devices \(DMDs\) and overall site consumption from smart meters.\rGovernance Data: Customer consent records, registration statuses, and prequalification results.\rStatic & Structural Data: Asset characteristics \(e.g., battery capacity, location\), party roles and identifiers, contract terms, eligibility criteria.\r\(Vertical Bullet List\))/Type/StructElem/K[ 1 2 3 4 5]/Pg 32 0 R /A 1020 0 R >>
