<</P 1025 0 R /S/Diagram/Alt(Interoperability & Standardisation: Replaces fragmented national standards with a unified European framework, lowering integration costs for manufacturers and service providers.\rGrid Stability: Enhances resilience by allowing grid operators to coordinate decentralized assets to prevent congestion and integrate more renewables.\rConsumer Empowerment: Prosumers gain "data sovereignty," using consent-based tools to participate in new markets and earn revenue from their flexible assets.\rMarket Transparency: Ensures that flexibility is quantified and settled accurately, building trust in the reliability of decentralised energy services.\r\(Icon Vertical Solid List\))/Type/StructElem/K[ 1 2 3 4]/Pg 33 0 R /A 1027 0 R >>
